&lt;li&gt;Routes deal packages to the correct reviewers and tracks open items so deals aren&#39;t stalled waiting on sign-off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; GTM Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
