&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineers and Operations to resolve technical blockers, debug delivery issues, and own technical escalations from customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the customer&#39;s technical experience throughout their time with Scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Account Executives and Product Managers to identify customer-specific feature requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop expertise in large language models, 2D image annotation, and API integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Scale and engage with customers at major events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
