&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth, technology, or SaaS/AI company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to SOX, IPO readiness, or audit-ready environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with international supplier onboarding and tax documentation (e.g., W-8/W-9, VAT), and knowledge of EU, Mexican (CFDI, SAT compliance) as well as other government’s requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Supply Chain, Finance, Industrial Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
