&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate and Prototype Visually: &lt;/strong&gt;Deliver polished verbal communication and visual storytelling using AI tools like Cursor and Claude Design to bring concepts to life&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
