&lt;li&gt;Find, shape, and close deals yourself, from the first conversation through to contract and into delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the relationships you already have across the MOD, Defence Digital, UK Strategic Command, DE&amp;amp;S, Dstl, and the security and intelligence community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work the defence routes to market, and know which are worth the effort and which aren&#39;t (the Defence Sourcing Portal, DASA, JOSCAR registration, single-source arrangements, and the main CCS frameworks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a credible counterpart to senior military and civil service leaders, and turn what they need into work we can actually deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate the security clearance, accreditation, and information-handling requirements that come with defence work&lt;/li&gt;
