&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve sold and delivered AI technology or transformation work into UK defence or national security, either from a vendor or SI or from inside the MOD or the Armed Forces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know at least one part of defence well (MOD, UK Strategic Command, DE&amp;amp;S, Dstl, or a single Service) and how it buys&lt;/li&gt;
