&lt;p&gt;Scale&#39;s Data Analytics team is centralized, embedding data analysts across delivery, operations, finance, and engineering to turn ambiguous problems into clear, actionable insights. As a Senior Data Analyst for Public Sector, you&#39;ll build analytics solutions from the ground up - partnering closely with cross-functional teams and leadership to solve complex problems, design dashboards, build tables, and perform ad-hoc analyses that shape how Scale runs and measures its Public Sector business.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who&#39;s relentlessly curious, comfortable owning ambiguity, and skilled at turning cross-functional relationships into sustainable, scalable analytics solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Active Secret U.S. security clearance required&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
