&lt;li&gt;Own data quality for your domain - document models, troubleshoot discrepancies, and establish centralized metric definitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to identify, define, and track key metrics to be used in monitoring, planning, and one-off decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable, scalable analytical solutions, such as dashboards, data models, or standard processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Ops to identify and track efficiency initiatives, measuring their impact on cost, quality, and delivery outcomes over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance to analyze cost drivers across programs and help inform pricing strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be willing to deepdive when needed and dig into the messy details to get to the root of a problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiate and drive complex projects to completion with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
