&lt;li&gt;6+ years of relevant work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL skills and experience building with data modeling tools (e.g. DBT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building dashboards and reports with BI tools (e.g. Tableau, Metabase)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen - comfortable partnering directly with cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
