an&gt;$331,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our policy requires a 90-day waiting period before reconsidering candidates for the same role. This allows us to ensure a fair and thorough evaluation of all applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
