&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience succeeding in stakeholder management or customer-facing role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or mentoring other program managers, engineers, or technical staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of the technical delivery of a complex, multi-workstream program with senior government or enterprise stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background (education or professional experience with CS, Economics, Statistics, Engineering)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of ML operations process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of software delivery pipelines and DevOps principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of structured, analytics-driven problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; 25–50% (typically 1–2 weeks per month on-site with CONUS and OCONUS customers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have a diverse team with a variety of skill sets, many have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
