&lt;li&gt;Experience in a Department of War or Intelligence Community operational environment, or supporting a combatant command&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering a technical platform or product that other teams build on top of, with a feel for the integration, versioning, and support burden that creates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough hands-on fluency with Python, SQL, and modern AI/ML tooling to interrogate data and prototypes directly, rather than relying on an engineer to answer every question&lt;/li&gt;
