&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Partner closely with HR to ensure accurate data flow for onboarding, offboarding, benefits deductions, and compensation changes. Ability to work with Accounting to ensure accurate general ledger mapping, month-end close procedures, and payroll account reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Administration &amp;amp; Optimization: Act as the primary subject matter expert for our payroll system (e.g., Workday, ADP). Identify bottlenecks, recommend process improvements, and lead system upgrades or implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue Resolution, Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Auditing: Conduct regular audits of payroll data to identify and resolve discrepancies. Serve as the ultimate point of continuous improvement with AI and other methodologies to ensure Scale’s payroll processes are best in class.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
